{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015704_898663a8","chunk_index":5,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6c6f891b8aa2debd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b036374cce02a515","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_11aad340a18d8fc7","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d4c842e938b24ef4"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015704_898663a8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_001"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f99734c87881f7d6c64a1421824e8d63df9b86db797b44cc550ce00fc96423c7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_016"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6c6f891b8aa2debd\n章节编号=4.5\n章节标题=研究结束与研究持续时间\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"5b93886df20b7659ec54ac82482577a5b4ecadf6f8739ca2251cdd57cad8c8c2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","span_id":"span_009"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_001","span_002","span_003","span_016","span_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究结束与研究持续时间","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究包括筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期。筛选期最长4周，在此期间完成入选和排除标准评估及基线检查；筛选合格后，受试者于基线/第1天随机，并进入双盲治疗期。双盲治疗期为16周，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，给药自第1天持续至第16周。治疗期访视安排在第2、4、8、12、16周，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价。双盲治疗期结束后进入安全性随访期，安全性随访期为4周，于第20周进行安全性随访访视。按上述计划，受试者个体研究参与时间最长约为24周（筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周），末例受试者完成第20周安全性随访访视后，本研究的计划访视全部结束。","rationale":"本节依据确认的研究时期、访视策略和给药方案撰写；医学作者需核对研究结束的正式定义、访视时间窗及提前终止流程。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6c6f891b8aa2debd","section_number":"4.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015704_898663a8","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究暂停和终止标准","missing_source_classes":["研究暂停与终止标准相关的申办方方案模板或安全性监测计划","研究者手册中与安全性风险相关的暂停/终止依据","数据监查委员会或独立安全性监查章程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"研究暂停和终止标准在允许来源中缺少项目特异性依据，无法在当前来源范围内生成实质正文。医学作者需补充相应来源材料后确认本章节内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b036374cce02a515","section_number":"4.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015704_898663a8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_011"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_013"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_014"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_015"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_004","span_005","span_006","span_010","span_011","span_012","span_013","span_014","span_015"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":9},"heading":"研究人群","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。入选受试者须年龄≥18岁，确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，且在筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，并适合接受系统治疗或光疗。排除标准包括：以非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；以及研究者判断不适合参加。上述人群定义与本研究在中国开展的III期、多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照设计一致，研究目标为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","rationale":"本节依据确认的目标人群定义、入选标准、排除标准及研究设计要素撰写；医学作者需核对研究者判断不适合参加的具体标准，以及是否需要补充流行病学依据。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究人群），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_11aad340a18d8fc7","section_number":"5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015704_898663a8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_015"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_004","span_005","span_006","span_007","span_015"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"研究人群选择及依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究人群选择为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，即确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。入选标准要求年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，并在筛选及基线时达到PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，同时适合接受系统治疗或光疗。排除标准将非斑块型银屑病为主要表现或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病、活动性严重感染、妊娠或哺乳期，以及研究者判断不适合参加者排除在外。上述入选与排除标准共同界定本研究的目标人群，并与本研究确证性目的相匹配。","rationale":"本节依据确认的目标人群定义及入选、排除标准撰写；医学作者需核对选择依据是否需要补充既往研究或流行病学数据支持，以及排除标准中研究者判断条款的操作定义。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究人群选择及依据），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d4c842e938b24ef4","section_number":"5.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2d0bab2369a9ed65d35cd0d2","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"eb57edd1a024598b8fc9ecd08e52e6712ed93c5a10b439f663b8989865a4140f"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"}]}